message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ColorCast: Color Transfer Toolkit for Python"
version: 2.1.1
date-released: 2026-07-14
abstract: "ColorCast is a Python toolkit for color and style transfer between images. It provides multiple algorithms including histogram matching, mean/std transfer, LUT-based curves, selective regional transfer, and GPU acceleration. The toolkit supports both GUI and CLI interfaces with caching and batch processing capabilities."
